      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "In a writing group, in hospital, teenagers' drawings help to evoke the body and its representation, at a time of life when all the changes to the body have an impact on the processes of constructing an identity. It is thereby possible to see how the teenager understands this body which expresses itself inseparably from the imaginary and the symbolic."
      },
